{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b1a53fb17fc4bff992e2c190144b7d7c72d3db0f2517dfc515aa8673d3b1f586", "ja": "（琴葉のPV撮影が終わった。琴葉が今まで重ねてきた\n努力と、夢に向かう思いが感じられるものになった！）", "zh": "（琴叶的PV拍摄结束了。成片充分展现了琴叶至今为止付出的努力，以及她朝着梦想前进的心情！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "d51b38389cd3c228ae570cdc7025239943cb0332429f251a13158550aee86a37", "ja": "お疲れさまです。\n……ふふっ、まだ体がふわふわしている気がします。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n……呵呵，我感觉身体好像还轻飘飘的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cb667a0aa81eff82e6ad8898892767062e11829cda52b492ea53728256b359ec", "ja": "お疲れさま。それだけ全力で取り組んでた証拠だな。\nスタッフさんも、思いが伝わってきたって褒めてたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了。那正是你全力以赴的证明。工作人员也夸你说，感受到了你的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "f32d33261e64e44faf6688905e4325bbbca041785941a621dec9d52cabb5efcc", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nそう言ってもらえて、少しホッとしました。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n听您这么说，我就稍微放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "2aae0897d9617f9453f243802475849162a0c00527e0c5aaebf7f9cc4eb47e69", "ja": "今日の撮影は、すごく気合いが入っていて……\n空回りしちゃってないか、気になっていたので。", "zh": "今天的拍摄，我特别投入……\n所以有点担心自己是不是太用力，反而白费劲了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1005_p", "source_sha256": "83128b15efd0e8537633fa25e31ae4f8b947816b8b27cf7c2f8e055baca0505d", "ja": "確かに、撮影前は緊張してるように見えたけど。\nそんなに心配はしてなかったんだ。", "zh": "确实，拍摄前看起来是有些紧张。\n不过我倒没那么担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "428021c91dd54e1532c6264deb6492eaea12ac93cf446803bd8eea56df73c751", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？\nでもどうして……。", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？\n可是为什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1007_p", "source_sha256": "91c55b4268633cf4f7712db1385eb6ad82939e2788d61817505868574ea6babc", "ja": "琴葉の表情を見たから、かな。\n気合いも入ってたし、大丈夫だって思ったんだ。", "zh": "也许是因为看到了琴叶的表情吧。\n她干劲十足的样子，让我觉得应该没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "a71e3abb78cac75c5b13be188a9c81d70c0d442b3337dc2ed837f7101289c500", "ja": "……わ、私の顔、見てたんですか？", "zh": "……你、你刚才一直在看我的脸吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1009_p", "source_sha256": "abd6853532d8f24ef81909a86dd0ae7fb14ad406f73f0a3f9cfdfc020d71c73f", "ja": "えっ？　……あっ！　見てたとは言ったけど、\n別にやましい意味じゃなくてだな……！", "zh": "诶？……啊！虽然我是说在看，不过并没有什么不正当的意思……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "e40a148ed03a2ddfbe2ade268af90888281468f13605e003ae52c642cd3c8548", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です。\n私、{$P$}のこと信じてますから！", "zh": "没、没关系。\n因为我相信{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "0977118a5f1bc9128347c5a86be9b7656d328bda3700f8fd8793e7b549587a27", "ja": "……って、何言ってるんだろう！？\nうう……すみません。少し風に当たってきます！", "zh": "……我到底在胡说什么啊！？\n呜呜……对不起。我去吹吹风！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1012_null", "source_sha256": "26bad7a9a0e63c7b8e956ffc3986f65b4a48ad74c64be68c4f7a5220d7922633", "ja": "30分後……", "zh": "30分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "36328792989bceed6516c8877a6a2f428c148610921f3d4c30372481edd5890f", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nさっきは取り乱して、すみませんでした。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n刚才我一时失控了，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1014_p", "source_sha256": "152d213f0e03b4bd1f6e4c677d8bb8ac7bccd778a0193bafca1340f3774da249", "ja": "こっちこそ、すまなかったな。\n……落ち着いたか？", "zh": "是我这边才对，该说对不起。\n……冷静下来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "2e36bb82d3a6c9eb8187f4b3065441afad297433cb77796342449905f0d75eb8", "ja": "はい。……あの！　お話……いえ、伝えたいことが\nあって。少しだけお時間いいですか？", "zh": "好的。……那个！我有些话……不，是有件想告诉您的事。可以占用您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1016_p", "source_sha256": "52c9138775b8b9a9e6ade07acf2534450e7fff65cf4c0a4137d338dd1694aa75", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "嗯，没问题哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "da184115e4138f14549f65b19f8619a36067abcf3547be0a31ee5cae963e75f5", "ja": "その……{$P$}はいつも、\nどんな時も、私のそばにいてくれましたよね。", "zh": "那个……{$P$}一直都陪在我身边，无论什么时候，都是这样，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "46e176a275cd5f73ec0c2d2fffdb0fd6736f38574bf74bbc35ffb767f2b327d9", "ja": "初めてのセンター公演の時だって……。悩んでいた私に\n手を差し伸べてくれて、勇気をくれました。", "zh": "就连第一次担任Center演出的时候也是……您向烦恼中的我伸出了援手，给予了我勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "316f5e5ee057297282be9e612a18a01106a344f669e3d4cecdc011a8fe55bcaa", "ja": "そんなふうに寄り添ってくれる\n{$P$}がいてくれたから私は……。", "zh": "正因为有愿意那样陪伴在我身边的{$P$}，我才能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "a7331269c72cd0930435f8eb84ca1d88283b7207a3a9abb64c98624abf48ee9b", "ja": "ううん、そんな{$P$}が\nずっと私の心の支えでした。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "不，是因为一直有那样的{$P$}陪在我身边，支撑着我的内心。谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c8884d18a0534a3f62f743ef90e0a1e39ff8b56bd2f19f341ab1a59e15e63f9b", "ja": "琴葉……。こちらこそありがとうな。", "zh": "琴叶……我才要谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1022_p", "source_sha256": "9e12e1637ecab79aa4f508c2610faabfca83267eb0a3d3b8d6faecff76d9fe54", "ja": "琴葉が夢を叶えるまで……いや、叶えた後も\n琴葉らしく輝き続けられるように。ずっと手伝うよ。", "zh": "在琴叶实现梦想之前……不，直到实现梦想之后，\n我也会一直帮助你，让你继续绽放出属于琴叶的光芒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0444_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "60d018d8c410f137fa983da45a6b0ff3d767499bc01351dca40644dfcdb5fca9", "ja": "はい！　これからも、よろしくお願いします。\n私の、プロデューサー！", "zh": "好的！今后也请多多关照。\n我的制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
